# Skill mirrors — generated by the installer from skills-lock.json.
# Canonical source is .agents/skills/ (tracked). These per-tool copies are
# regenerable, so keep them out of git. NOTE: /skills/ is root-anchored on
# purpose — a bare "skills/" would also match .agents/skills/ and hide new
# canonical skills from git.
